  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">The country&#x2019;s resultant instability has been caused and sustained by a set of structural economic conditions, ensuring low growth and a lack of inclusiveness in the economy. These are built on two primary and contradictory realities. The first is the nature and objectives of elite (including military) control and related conflict, centered on a small number of people acting as gatekeepers for the country&#x2019;s resources, and the maintenance of patronage networks to bolster their political support. T</narrative>
  </description>
